error[E0520]: 'partial' only means something for a match of an enum that has no default case
 --> test-code/errors/x64/E0520-match-partial-invalid.mu:5:13
  |
3 | main :: proc() Int ->
4 |     n := 1
5 |     match #(partial) n ->
  |             ^^^^^^^
6 |         case 1 ->
7 |             n = 2
  |
  = note: a match of an enum that has no default case is the only match that must have a case for
          every value
